.claude/plans/PLAN-178/staged-loteB/codex_loteB_r1.md:24:  If any workflow prompt contains `CAN edit: *`, `CAN edit: none`, or another placeholder-only value, this regex sets `faOk` and dispatches it even though ADR-191 requires a concrete path or the exact `NONE-READ-ONLY` token. The same validator is duplicated in all four modified workflows, so malformed assignment drift bypasses the intended pre-dispatch gate everywhere.
