.claude/plans/PLAN-177/repass-rc4-20260816-t9-NOGO/transcript-rc4-2.log:30894: trailing whitespace.
+   `_preview_claude_dir_gitignore` says `would PRESERVE`; the real install/upgrade appends a trailing `/settings.local.json` to reassert it. Thus dry-run and execution disagree, contradicting both the CHANGELOG and signed-tag headline’s “honest dry-run previews.” S9 tests only real apply, so the positive control misses this regression.  
